{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dead as Disco</strong> puts you in the shoes of <strong>Charlie Disco</strong>, a fallen icon with one chance to reclaim the spotlight from the <strong>Idols </strong>\u2013 Charlie\u2019s ex-bandmates and musical legends. Confront the Idols in stylish combat that syncs to every song, and survive a world torn apart by music, fame, and betrayal In this action-packed, literal Beat \u2018Em Up.<br><br><strong>The Dead as Disco Demo includes the following game content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorial, Learn the basics on Beat Kune Do where music meets melee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sample Story Mission, Face off against the Idol Hemlock at his underground concert deep in the subways that run below the city streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite Disco, Test your skill and go infinite in a wave based combat arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11 Songs, rock out to a sample of our original music library and licensed tracks from Monstercat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Song Importing, Bust skulls to your favorite Jams! Import your own music (MP3) into Infinite Disco to create custom experiences.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global &amp; Friend Leaderboards, compete against your friends or the world and see if you can claim the Next Fest crown!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock even more exciting content and features in the full game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/extras/EN_01_Top.gif?t=1748578341\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/extras/EN_02_Music+Melee_final.gif?t=1748578341\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/extras/EN_03_EpicBosses_final.gif?t=1748578341\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/extras/EN_04_Upload.gif?t=1748578341\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/extras/EN_05_Coop.gif?t=1748578341\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763830?t=1748578341","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/d7b87c78e5e3f439c7a88933385fdeefc9d98aa0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748578341","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/8473fe8db2c81e6e75cd6b2bdb3eda829b60d35c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748578341","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763830/8473fe8db2c81e6e75cd6b2bdb3eda829b60d35c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748578341","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dead as Disco</strong> puts you in the shoes of <strong>Charlie Disco</strong>, a fallen icon with one chance to reclaim the spotlight from the <strong>Idols </strong>\u2013 Charlie\u2019s ex-bandmates and musical legends. Confront the Idols in stylish combat that syncs to every song, and survive a world torn apart by music, fame, and betrayal In this action-packed, literal Beat \u2018Em Up.<br><br><strong>The Dead as Disco Demo includes the following game content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tutorial, Learn the basics on Beat Kune Do where music meets melee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sample Story Mission, Face off against the Idol Hemlock at his underground concert 